<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
'''Settings''' are preferences to customize your VRChat experience. This article provides a verbose explanation for the amount of settings in VRChat. Menus for settings can be found in the [[Special:MyLanguage/Quick Menu|Quick Menu]], [[Special:MyLanguage/Main Menu|Main Menu]], and [[Special:MyLanguage/Action Menu|Action Menu]].
</div>

