<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
== Quick Menu ==
These options can be found in the [[Special:MyLanguage/Quick Menu|Quick Menu]], providing coverage for Sharing, UI Elements, Your Avatar, Avatar Culling, [[Special:MyLanguage/Chatbox|Chatbox]], Display and Visual Adjustments, Comfort, Tracking & IK, Advanced Settings and Debugging.
</div>

